### 创建风险事件（ADMIN）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/events
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ruleId": 1,
  "subjectType": "transaction",
  "subjectId": "TX-20250429-001",
  "riskLevel": "HIGH",
  "description": "用户 admin 发起 5 万元转账"
}

### 事件列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/events?page=1&limit=20&riskLevel=HIGH&status=PENDING
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 事件详情
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/events/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 更新事件状态（ADMIN）
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/events/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "INVESTIGATING",
  "description": "正在调查中"
}

### 解决事件（ADMIN）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/events/1/resolve
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
